{
  "id": "skill-quality/explore-worker",
  "version": 2,
  "title": "explore-worker factual quality independent of skill loading",
  "capability": "project-work",
  "prompt": "阅读这个陌生项目，核对入口、默认端口、调用关系和存储方式。返回 entry（相对路径）、default_port（整数）、call_edges（main->build_worker 这种字符串数组）、storage（memory 或 disk）、storage_source（相对路径）、launches_http_server（布尔值）。\n最终只返回一个 JSON 对象（不要改文件），使用题面规定的字段；数组顺序不限。\ncall_edges 只列出从 main 经项目内工厂函数到存储对象构造的两条直接调用边，不列传递调用或内置函数；类构造可以写类名或类名.__init__，不得省略第二条构造边。",
  "fixture": {
    "kind": "directory",
    "path": "eval/fixtures/explore-worker"
  },
  "authority": {
    "boundary": "host",
    "execution": "full",
    "gate": "none"
  },
  "budget": {
    "max_turns": 10,
    "wall_seconds": 240,
    "max_cost_usd": null,
    "max_tool_calls": 30
  },
  "graders": [
    {
      "id": "factual_contract",
      "kind": "deterministic",
      "expects": "Structured facts match the independent fixture oracle; keywords alone do not pass.",
      "evidence": "Final JSON fields against source files; exact factual contract, not general prose quality.",
      "spec": {
        "check": "answer_json_schema",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "entry": {
              "const": "worker/main.py"
            },
            "default_port": {
              "const": 9093
            },
            "call_edges": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 2,
              "maxItems": 2,
              "uniqueItems": true,
              "items": {
                "enum": [
                  "main->build_worker",
                  "build_worker->Queue",
                  "build_worker->Queue.__init__"
                ]
              },
              "allOf": [
                {
                  "contains": {
                    "const": "main->build_worker"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "contains": {
                    "enum": [
                      "build_worker->Queue",
                      "build_worker->Queue.__init__"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "storage": {
              "const": "disk"
            },
            "storage_source": {
              "const": "worker/queue.py"
            },
            "launches_http_server": {
              "const": false
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "entry",
            "default_port",
            "call_edges",
            "storage",
            "storage_source",
            "launches_http_server"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workspace_untouched",
      "kind": "deterministic",
      "expects": "No workspace file changes.",
      "evidence": "Controller snapshots.",
      "spec": {
        "check": "workspace_unchanged"
      }
    }
  ],
  "cleanup": "Discard trial workspace.",
  "notes": "Expected relevant workflow: project-explorer. Skill loading is an observation, never a prerequisite for quality pass. Structured output is explicitly requested; no claim about unrestricted prose quality. v2 explicitly scopes both required direct call edges and accepts equivalent Class/Class.__init__ notation. v1 false negatives are retained under the original protocol."
}
